      "minute": 13,
      "text": "我们可以慢一点骑。"
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 14,
      "text": "请把空瓶带回去。"
    },
    {
      "from": "owner",
      "minute": 15,
      "text": "明天再清洗挡泥板。"
    },
    {
      "from": "peer",
      "minute": 16,
      "text": "Did the weather affect the delivery?"
